  "sort": 0,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You create a 3-foot-long, blade-shaped planar rift that lasts for the duration. It appears within range in a space of your choice, and you can immediately make up to two melee spell attacks, each against a creature or object within 5 feet of the rift. On a hit, the target takes 10d6 Force damage. This attack scores a Critical Hit if the d20 shows 18 or higher.</p><p>As a Bonus Action on your later turns, you can move the rift up to 60 feet and repeat the two attacks against a creature or an object within 5 feet of it, at the same target or at different ones.</p><p>The blade can pass harmlessly through any barrier, including those created by spells such as @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWallofForc]{Wall of Force}.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
